  message: "Wave 5 PR #1 of 6 merged in PR #3572 (commit 2e4721c59). Edge.evidence_type framework_dispatch producers folded for: websocket.py (10 dynamic-emit values via single f-string rewrite — django_channels_emit/endpoint, fastapi_emit/endpoint, native_emit/endpoint, socketio_emit/endpoint, ws_emit/endpoint), tauri_ipc.py (tauri_invoke, tauri_emit_listen, specta_wrapper_import — note specta uses ast_import canonical not ast_call_direct), grpc.py (4 values: grpc_go_server_method, grpc_service_match, grpc_server_to_service, grpc_rpc_definition), openapi.py (openapi_path_match, openapi_operation_id_match). Total: 19 evidence_types across 4 files. Item stays todo_hard."  # 6472
